Package: PlantCellFM
Type: Package
Title: R Interface to Plant-CellFM and PlantCell-Agent
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Plant-CellFM", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "plantcellfm@example.org")
Description: Provides an R interface to the Plant-CellFM plant single-cell
    annotation model and the evidence-aware PlantCell-Agent workflow. Users
    can run local annotations through the Python command line interface,
    submit server-side annotation jobs, and read predictions, review queues,
    marker evidence, routing decisions, and reproducibility traces into R.
